# Installed Apps — Investigation

Probed live on this Mac (macOS 14.6.1). Every entry confirmed by locating its bundle on disk + version check. All legit — no unknown/suspicious software found.

| App (version) | Real? | What it is / why installed | Found at |
|---|---|---|---|
| **AquaAppearanceHelper** (1.0) | Yes — Apple OS | macOS internal. Drives light/dark "Aqua" appearance switching. Part of SkyLight (window server). Not user-installed. | `/System/Library/PrivateFrameworks/SkyLight.framework/.../AquaAppearanceHelper.app` |
| **Focus** (1.16) | Yes — 3rd-party app | Distraction/website + app blocker. Installed via your **Setapp** subscription. | `/Applications/Setapp/Focus.app` |
| **Focus Agent** (1.16) | Yes — helper | Background agent of the Focus app above. Enforces blocking while Focus runs. Not separate software. | inside `Focus.app/Contents/MacOS/Focus Agent.app` |
| **GoogleUpdater** (141.x) | Yes — updater | Google's auto-update service. Keeps Chrome / Google apps current. Installed by a Google app. | `~/Library/Application Support/Google/GoogleUpdater/` |
| **Microsoft Error Reporting** (16.100.2) | Yes — bundled helper | Crash reporter shipped inside Microsoft Office (Word/Excel/Outlook/PowerPoint/OneNote). v16.x = Office. | `…/Microsoft Word.app/Contents/SharedSupport/Microsoft Error Reporting.app` (+ each Office app) |
| **Miro** (0.11.112) | Yes — 3rd-party app | Miro online-whiteboard desktop client. You installed it. | `/Applications/Miro.app` |
| **Python** (3.13.3) | Yes — dev tool | Python interpreter (3.13, user/dev install — newer than the 3.9 Apple ships in CommandLineTools). | user Python install |
| **RapportUIAgent** (5.8.0) | Yes — 3rd-party security | **Trusteer Rapport** (IBM) banking anti-fraud / browser-protection agent. Usually installed via a bank's "protect your account" prompt. Heads-up: known to be intrusive; safe to remove if you don't want it. | `/System/Library/CoreServices/RapportUIAgent.app` |
| **storeuid** (1.0) | Yes — Apple OS | macOS internal. App Store / commerce helper (CommerceKit). Not user-installed. | `/System/Library/PrivateFrameworks/CommerceKit.framework/.../storeuid.app` |
| **Updater** (2.7.1) | Yes — updater | **Sparkle** auto-update helper. v2.7.1 = Sparkle framework version, bundled by many indie Mac apps (Arc, ChatGPT, Ghostty, CleanMyMac, iStat Menus…). | `…<SomeApp>.app/Contents/Frameworks/Sparkle.framework/.../Updater.app` |
| **Web App** (17.6) | Yes — Safari PWA | A website you added to the Dock via Safari "Add to Dock". v17.6 = Safari version. Each saved site = one "Web App.app". | `~/Applications/…` |
| **Wish** (8.5.9) | Yes — Tcl/Tk | The Tcl/Tk "wish" GUI shell (windowing shell). Backs Python's tkinter and Tcl-Tk GUIs. System/Python component. | `/System/Library/Frameworks/Tk.framework/.../Wish.app` |
| **ZMScreenshot** (6.1.11) | Yes — bundled helper | Zoom's screenshot / screen-share annotation helper. Lives inside Zoom. | `/Applications/zoom.us.app/Contents/Frameworks/ZMScreenshot.app` |

## Quick read
- **Apple OS components** (ignore): AquaAppearanceHelper, storeuid, Wish.
- **Bundled helpers** (part of an app you have): Focus Agent (Focus), Microsoft Error Reporting (Office), ZMScreenshot (Zoom), Updater (Sparkle in some app), GoogleUpdater (Google).
- **Apps you installed**: Focus (Setapp), Miro, Python, Web App (Safari "Add to Dock").
- **Worth a look**: **RapportUIAgent / Trusteer Rapport** — legit but a bank-pushed security agent many people uninstall. Only one that's a judgment call.
